[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569639876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101082#issuecomment-2569639876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101082","id":2569639876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKZfE","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T18:21:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T18:23:06Z","body":"> Results are for dev build, so difference in optimized build may be not so big, but still should be.\r\n\r\nI definitely recommend running the test on a non-dev build, because non-optimized builds are rarely representative of optimized ones. \r\n\r\n`expand_to ` is implemented in `rect.h` and thus fully visible to the compiler. _Theoretically_, that means it could be optimized away - it probably isn't because it's dealing with floats - but it's good practice to check anyway :) ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569639876/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"conf